Description: Newly Registered Domains (NRDs) tracker and threat intelligence extractor
 NetHound is an OSINT and threat intelligence automation utility designed to
 monitor, extract, and index Newly Registered Domains (NRDs) across global
 registries including .IN, .COM, and generic TLDs.
 .
 It facilitates real-time tracking of emerging infrastructure, phishing
 campaigns, brand impersonation, and typosquatting vectors.
